 | BUILDCRETE
 | Acrylic Polymer For Waterproofing And Repair
 | TECHNICAL DATA SHEET VER NO. N.1
PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONS
Trubuild Buildcrete is an acrylic polymer-based compound that forms a matrix when mixed with cement with excellent
waterprooﬁng properties. Trubuild Buildcrete enhances the properties of cement slurry/ mortar, making it an excellent
choice to use it in new as well as renovation work. It is ideal for waterprooﬁng of toilet, kitchen, bathroom, terrace, swimming
pool & basement etc.
