Step-4
Curing: After moist curing for 24 hrs, the surface should be allowed to air cure for 3 to
5 days before laying a protective screed.
PRECAUTIONS
Mandatory and recommended industrial hygiene procedures should be followed whenever our products are being handled
and used. For additional information please read Material Safety Data Sheets and follow the standards.
