STORAGE
Store in a dry cool place in the temperature range from 5°C to 30°C under sealed conditions. Do not allow to freeze. Keep
away from direct sunlight
COVERAGE
25-30 sqft./kg/2 coat
NOTE- Coverage may vary due to undulation and porosity of the substrate
SHELF LIFE
24 months from the date of manufacturing
